## B. Procurement Manager

The Procurement Manager is based at Head Office.

Permissions:

- View inventory across all three branches.
- View consolidated stock levels.
- View low-stock reports across branches.
- Manage suppliers.
- Create purchase orders.
- Edit draft purchase orders.
- Track purchase order statuses.
- Review incoming stock.
- View procurement reports.
- View inventory valuation reports.
- Access cross-branch inventory data.
