## C. Branch Manager

Branch Managers must only access information relevant to their assigned branch, except where explicitly authorized.

Permissions:

- View stock at their branch.
- View branch dashboard.
- View branch low-stock products.
- Record or supervise stock intake.
- View stock issues.
